{"4241610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SINVAULT", "steam_appid": 4241610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A controversial decision you made as a judge has come back to haunt you. Years later, you are kidnapped by a family seeking their own justice and buried alive in a coffin. When you wake up, there is darkness, limited air, and only a handful of tools to fight for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape this grave, you must decide who to trust, when to act, and which choices will keep you alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SMS-Based Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow every conversation carefully. Important numbers and clues may require you to take real notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/7f07b9326db3a1a5d91e2b5f1c069214.poster.avif?t=1767218501\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/7f07b9326db3a1a5d91e2b5f1c069214.webm?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/7f07b9326db3a1a5d91e2b5f1c069214.mp4?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Limited Time and Oxygen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to finish the story, but your items and your breath must be managed wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/ec66d722b9e625f6acdb38d61af07008.poster.avif?t=1767218501\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/ec66d722b9e625f6acdb38d61af07008.webm?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/ec66d722b9e625f6acdb38d61af07008.mp4?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Intense Psychological Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you stay calm inside a 5m² coffin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/baaf315cff5900c47487a2d01fabb9bd.poster.avif?t=1767218501\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/baaf315cff5900c47487a2d01fabb9bd.webm?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/baaf315cff5900c47487a2d01fabb9bd.mp4?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMS-Based Narrative Survival</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Sound Design</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“What is justice? And what happens when justice turns against you?”</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A controversial decision you made as a judge has come back to haunt you. Years later, you are kidnapped by a family seeking their own justice and buried alive in a coffin. When you wake up, there is darkness, limited air, and only a handful of tools to fight for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape this grave, you must decide who to trust, when to act, and which choices will keep you alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SMS-Based Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow every conversation carefully. Important numbers and clues may require you to take real notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/7f07b9326db3a1a5d91e2b5f1c069214.poster.avif?t=1767218501\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/7f07b9326db3a1a5d91e2b5f1c069214.webm?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/7f07b9326db3a1a5d91e2b5f1c069214.mp4?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Limited Time and Oxygen</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to finish the story, but your items and your breath must be managed wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/ec66d722b9e625f6acdb38d61af07008.poster.avif?t=1767218501\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/ec66d722b9e625f6acdb38d61af07008.webm?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/ec66d722b9e625f6acdb38d61af07008.mp4?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Intense Psychological Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you stay calm inside a 5m² coffin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/baaf315cff5900c47487a2d01fabb9bd.poster.avif?t=1767218501\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/baaf315cff5900c47487a2d01fabb9bd.webm?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/extras/baaf315cff5900c47487a2d01fabb9bd.mp4?t=1767218501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMS-Based Narrative Survival</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Graphics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Quality Sound Design</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>“What is justice? And what happens when justice turns against you?”</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "You wake up trapped inside a coffin. With only a restricted phone at your side, reach the right people and try to stay alive. Oxygen is running out, sand is filling in, and every message you send shapes your fate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4241610/9a799a71544357e475ad866d5e7aee16032121eb/header.jpg?t=1767218501", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea